{"id":109,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"قُلْ يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"Qul yaa-ai yuhal kaafiroon","translation":"Say, \"O disbelievers,"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"Laa a'budu ma t'abudoon","translation":"I do not worship what you worship."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Wa laa antum 'aabidoona maa a'bud","translation":"Nor are you worshippers of what I worship."},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٌۭ مَّا عَبَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"Wa laa ana 'abidum maa 'abattum","translation":"Nor will I be a worshipper of what you worship."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"Wa laa antum 'aabidoona ma a'bud","translation":"Nor will you be worshippers of what I worship."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ دِينِ","transliteration":"Lakum deenukum wa liya deen.","translation":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion.\""}]}